# FPLReview's exported projections — a paid competitor's product, read at
# runtime by frontend/lib/fplreview-projections.ts and absent everywhere but
# this machine. Ignored so it can never be committed: it must not be
# redistributed, and a static import of it once made the whole site unbuildable
# from a clean checkout. See frontend/test/no-untracked-imports.test.ts.
frontend/data/fplreview-projections.json
